          "markup": "<section data-label=\"Objetivo\" data-speaker-notes=\"Cuatro metas concretas. Root existe porque Linux lo necesita, pero no podrá iniciar sesión; toda tarea administrativa pasa por un usuario auditado.\" class=\"sd\">\n    <div class=\"steplabel\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">OBJETIVO</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:var(--gap-title);\">Qué buscamos conseguir</h2>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px 40px;max-width:1560px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:28px 30px;\">\n        <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--green);font-size:34px;line-height:1;\">✓</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:var(--type-body);line-height:1.4;\">Root <strong>existirá</strong> porque Linux lo necesita</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:28px 30px;\">\n        <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--green);font-size:34px;line-height:1;\">✓</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:var(--type-body);line-height:1.4;\">Root <strong>no podrá</strong> iniciar sesión</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:28px 30px;\">\n        <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--green);font-size:34px;line-height:1;\">✓</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:var(--type-body);line-height:1.4;\">La administración pasa por un <strong>usuario administrador</strong></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:28px 30px;\">\n        <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--green);font-size:34px;line-height:1;\">✓</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:var(--type-body);line-height:1.4;\">Se <strong>reduce</strong> la superficie de ataque</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">Hardening de root · Linux</div>\n    <div class=\"dot\">03</div>\n  </section>"
        }
