          "markup": "<section data-label=\"Paso 1\" data-speaker-notes=\"Creamos el usuario y lo añadimos al grupo de administración: sudo en Debian/Ubuntu, wheel en RHEL/CentOS. id confirma la pertenencia.\" class=\"sd\">\n    <div class=\"steplabel\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">PASO 01</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:var(--gap-title);\">Crear el usuario administrador</h2>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px 40px;max-width:1620px;align-items:start;\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">CREAR EL USUARIO</div>\n        <div class=\"cmd\"><span style=\"color:var(--green);\">$</span> adduser administrador</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">COMPROBAR</div>\n        <div class=\"cmd\"><span style=\"color:var(--green);\">$</span> id administrador</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">DEBIAN / UBUNTU</div>\n        <div class=\"cmd\"><span style=\"color:var(--green);\">$</span> usermod -aG <span style=\"color:var(--amber);\">sudo</span> administrador</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">RHEL / CENTOS</div>\n        <div class=\"cmd\"><span style=\"color:var(--green);\">$</span> usermod -aG <span style=\"color:var(--amber);\">wheel</span> administrador</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:var(--type-small);color:var(--muted);margin-top:28px;\">En la salida de <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--ink);\">id</span> debe aparecer <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--amber);\">sudo</span> o <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--amber);\">wheel</span>.</p>\n    <div class=\"foot\">Hardening de root · Linux</div>\n    <div class=\"dot\">04</div>\n  </section>"
        }
      ]
    },
