          },
          "markup": "<section data-label=\"Paso 3\" data-speaker-notes=\"Bloqueamos la contraseña de root con passwd -l. El estado L en passwd -S confirma que está Locked.\" class=\"sd\">\n    <div class=\"steplabel\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">PASO 03</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:var(--gap-title);\">Bloquear la contraseña de root</h2>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px 40px;max-width:1620px;align-items:start;\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">BLOQUEAR</div>\n        <div class=\"cmd\"><span style=\"color:var(--green);\">$</span> passwd -l root</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">VERIFICAR</div>\n        <div class=\"cmd\"><span style=\"color:var(--green);\">$</span> passwd -S root</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin-top:34px;\">\n      <div class=\"cap\" style=\"color:var(--green);\">SALIDA ESPERADA</div>\n      <div class=\"cmd\" style=\"border-color:rgba(92,212,138,.35);\">root <span style=\"color:var(--amber);\">L</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:var(--type-small);color:var(--muted);margin-top:24px;\">La <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--amber);\">L</span> significa <strong style=\"color:var(--ink);\">Locked</strong> (bloqueada).</p>\n    <div class=\"foot\">Hardening de root · Linux</div>\n    <div class=\"dot\">06</div>\n  </section>"
        }
      ]
