          "markup": "<section data-label=\"Paso 4\" data-speaker-notes=\"Cambiamos el shell de root a nologin para que ningún intento de sesión interactiva prospere. Verificamos leyendo /etc/passwd.\" class=\"sd\">\n    <div class=\"steplabel\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">PASO 04</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:var(--gap-title);\">Cambiar el shell de root</h2>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px 40px;max-width:1620px;align-items:start;\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">VER EL SHELL ACTUAL</div>\n        <div class=\"cmd\"><span style=\"color:var(--green);\">$</span> grep \"^root:\" /etc/passwd</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">CAMBIAR A NOLOGIN</div>\n        <div class=\"cmd\"><span style=\"color:var(--green);\">$</span> usermod -s /usr/sbin/nologin root</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin-top:34px;\">\n      <div class=\"cap\" style=\"color:var(--green);\">LA LÍNEA DEBE TERMINAR EN</div>\n      <div class=\"cmd\" style=\"border-color:rgba(92,212,138,.35);color:var(--green);\">/usr/sbin/nologin</div>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:var(--type-small);color:var(--muted);margin-top:24px;\">En algunos sistemas la ruta es <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--ink);\">/sbin/nologin</span>.</p>\n    <div class=\"foot\">Hardening de root · Linux</div>\n    <div class=\"dot\">07</div>\n  </section>"
        }
